h help help overview sample s sample-05 getting-started bash-tutorial-sql mrva-flow bench-intro shell-workflow two-user-standalone two-user-workflow zlib-study
status status cgawf
root root cgawf
doctor doctor cgawf
cn chain cgawf start list ls current switch show rename
st state cgawf show diff validate export import
step step cgawf show diff
log log cgawf
tree tree cgawf show
config config cgawf list get set unset path
store store cgawf show set check verify
artifact artifact cgawf add list show verify path materialize
run run run start stop status build seed
view view cga-view
uv unified-view cgauv start stop status outline search
gateway gateway gateway start status stop
public-html public-html public-html setup
github.io github.io github.io setup
llm llm llm context cb cu
show show vid
