serve serve serve start stop status build seed outputs
dl db-lib cgadl getmeta keys values list select sql download info serve
ql query-lib cgaql index keys values list select sql pack clean info serve
a assist cgaassist query-writing q database-build d
bench bench cgabench init session infrastructure catalogue library choose-databases choose-query create-query edit-query database query work tool advance compare show info serve stop
cc coder cgacc install info serve
mr mrva-request cgamr submit attach status download run info verify reset serve
